  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can communicate and understand simple concepts with any animal, magical beast, or vermin that lacks a language. Its comprehension is limited by its Intelligence, but even a mindless creature can understand simple directions to food or warnings about danger. You take a –4 penalty on skill checks that would otherwise be impossible to attempt with the creature. You can use the associated skill in place of Handle Animal to push an animal. In addition, you unlock skill leverage with Handle Animal.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/communication#toc7\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
